### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Miha",
  "email": "miha.demo@skillboost.local",
  "role": "STUDENT",
  "goals": ["Boljša komunikacija", "Javno nastopanje"],
  "targetSkills": ["public-speaking", "conflict-resolution"]
}

### Skills
GET http://localhost:8080/api/skills

### Challenges by skill
GET http://localhost:8080/api/challenges/skill/public-speaking

### Prompts by skill
GET http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/skill/public-speaking

### Add new mock LLM prompt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/prompts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillKey": "team-collaboration",
  "title": "Daily standup coach",
  "difficulty": "BEGINNER",
  "systemPrompt": "You are a practical soft-skills coach.",
  "userPromptTemplate": "Give feedback for a daily standup answer: {{answer}}",
  "simulatedAiResponse": "Mock response: mention blockers clearly, keep it short, and ask for help early.",
  "tags": ["standup", "team", "communication"]
}

### Submit training session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID",
  "challengeId": "REPLACE_WITH_CHALLENGE_ID",
  "skillKey": "public-speaking",
  "userAnswer": "Dober dan, danes bom predstavil problem, rešitev in naslednje korake. Najprej bom pojasnil kontekst, potem bom prikazal rezultat in na koncu predlagal akcijski načrt."
}

### Mentor note
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID/mentor-note
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorNote": "Dober nastop, naslednjič dodaj še konkreten primer in bolj jasen zaključek."
}

### Report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID

### Testiranje pravega Gemini API-ja
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "TUKAJ_PRILEPI_PRAVI_ID_IZ_MONGO",
  "challengeId": "TUKAJ_PRILEPI_PRAVI_ID_IZ_CHALLENGA",
  "skillKey": "public-speaking",
  "userAnswer": "Zivjo, rad bi vam predstavil naso novo aplikacijo SkillBoost, ki resuje problem ucenja mehkih vescin s pomocjo umetne inteligence."
}
